sequenceDiagram
  %% Target design: ADR 0244 task + full intent as inputs, single-swamp-node; DECISIONS 1 (token at admission, vault.get) + scope (instance.clone: Process/Schedule definitions, preview Route, DNS held).
  %% status: draft
  autonumber
  %% lane CLI icon=terminal pill=caller tone=gray
  %% lane GW icon=gateway pill=intent tone=blue
  %% lane SW icon=workflow pill=executes tone=green
  %% lane C icon=server pill=target tone=purple
  %% lane N icon=server pill=target tone=amber
  participant CLI as CLI / MCP<br/>orbit · MCP tools
  participant GW as Gateway<br/>Laravel API
  participant SW as Swamp<br/>serve on Node 209
  participant C as Candidate<br/>app-dev over ssh
  participant N as Target Node<br/>app-prod over ssh
  CLI->>GW: instance:clone<br/>{candidate: 42, node: 14, name}
  Note over GW: Reserve Instance 43<br/>env + token → vault · #5130
  GW->>SW: Start run, full intent<br/>operation-instance-clone
  GW-->>CLI: 202 Accepted<br/>operation #5130
  SW->>C: Check candidate source<br/>@swamp/ssh · branch, commit, clean
  SW->>N: Fetch, check out branch<br/>vault.get token · git as Node user
  SW->>N: Write .env, install Vite+<br/>vault.get .env · vp install
  SW->>N: Add Processes, Schedules<br/>process/schedule.create shape
  SW->>N: Publish preview Route<br/>same-Node Caddy · DNS held
  alt all steps succeed
    N-->>SW: commit, env keys, runtime
    SW-->>GW: Run succeeded<br/>terminal event · clone.result
    Note over GW: Project source facts<br/>Instance 43 active, preview Route
  else a step fails
    N--xSW: exit ≠ 0 or timeout
    SW--xGW: Run failed<br/>failed_step, error_code
    Note over GW: Keep Instance 43 reserved<br/>task → failed · retry reuses it
  end
  loop every 2 s until terminal
    CLI->>GW: operation:show #5130
    GW-->>CLI: status + result
  end
